+
+No decision on the wire serialisation format is currently recorded for this project, so this policy sets no value. The only trace is an unconfirmed remark in an earlier session naming CBOR; it was not recorded as a decision and is not adopted here. Until a decision is recorded, do not treat any wire format as settled.
